.********************************************************************
.* HELP TEXT for Parameter: CASE
.*
:HELP NAME='ANLSRCF/CASE'.
1=Same case, 2=Ignore case (CASE) - Hilfetext
:P.
:XH3.CASE (1=Same case, 2=Ignore case)
:P.
Choose if case of character strings is to be ignored or not.
:P.
:PARML.
:PT.1
:PD.Type 1 if case must be the identical.
:PT.2
:PD.Type 2 if case is to ignore.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
.********************************************************************
.* HELP TEXT for Parameter: SBMJOB
.*
:HELP NAME='ANLSRCF/SBMJOB'.
Submit to batch (SBMJOB) - Hilfetext
:P.
:XH3.SBMJOB (Submit to batch)
:P.
Choose whether to submit this job as batch job or run
interactively.
:P.
:PARML.
:PT.Y
:PD.Type Y to submit a batch job. This is recommended if
:CIT.*ALLUSR:ECIT.
is specified for source library.
:PT.N
:PD.Type N if you want to run this job interactively.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
.********************************************************************
:EPNLGRP.
